# Brainitive — Project Overview

Brainitive is an all-in-one workspace platform for teams: workspaces, Kanban boards, wiki/docs, rich editors, whiteboard (Excalidraw), and bookmarks. It's a Laravel 12 + Inertia.js + React 18 + TypeScript monolith.

## Brand Colors

- Blue: `#0E83DC` (primary actions, links)
- Dark Slate: `#485E72` (text, headings, secondary)
- Green: `#69A748` (success, checkmarks, publishing)
- Light Gray: `#C0C5C0` (borders, muted elements)
- Page Background: `#F4F6F8`

## Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|---|---|
| Backend | PHP 8.2, Laravel 12 |
| Frontend | React 18, TypeScript 5, Inertia.js v2 |
| CSS | Tailwind CSS 3 + shadcn/ui (new-york style) + Radix UI |
| Rich Text | Editor.js, Tiptap 3, Lexical |
| Whiteboard | Excalidraw |
| Auth | Laravel Breeze + Sanctum, email verification |
| Authorization | Policy-based + Spatie laravel-permission |
| Routing | Ziggy (route() helper in JS) |
| Forms | react-hook-form + Zod |
| Icons | Lucide React |
| Toasts | Sonner |
| DB | SQLite default (configurable) |
| Queue | Laravel queue |
| Code Style | Laravel Pint (PHP), Prettier-like (TS/TSX) |

## Data Hierarchy

```
Workspace → Project → Board → Column → Item
Workspace → Project → Page (nested tree)
Workspace → Bookmark → BookmarkItem
```

## Roles

- **Workspace**: owner, admin, editor, viewer, member
- **Project**: admin, editor, viewer
- **Bookmark**: creator, editor, viewer (collaborator)
- **Instance Admin**: bypasses all policy checks

## Key Conventions

- Use `slug` for route model binding on Workspace, Project, Board
- Use `uuid` for route model binding on Page, Bookmark
- Auto-generate UUID and slug in model `boot()` creating event
- Use `$fillable` arrays (not `$guarded`) on all models
- Use `SoftDeletes` on main models
- Inline validation in controllers (not separate FormRequest classes, except ProfileUpdateRequest)
- Inertia responses: `Inertia::render('PageName', [...props])`
- TypeScript interfaces in `resources/js/types/index.d.ts`
- Path alias: `@/` → `resources/js/`
